//C. Formatted YoY KPI Text Labels

Displays directional arrows (▲ / ▼) with localized Arabic percentage-point (نقطة) or % formatting inside KPI reference labels.

# YOY Change - GOSI = 
VAR Change = [_YOY num GOSI]
RETURN
SWITCH(
    TRUE(),
    Change > 0, "▲ " & FORMAT(Change, "0.0 %"),
    Change < 0, "▼ " & FORMAT(ABS(Change), "0.0 %"),
    NOT ISBLANK(Change), "—",
    BLANK()
)


